### HU-09: sondas HTTP de salud (Kubernetes y Argo CD).
### Ejecutar contra la API y la web en local o mediante kubectl -n quipux-playlist port-forward (quickstart.md).
###
### Not covered here (no se validan por una petición HTTP individual; ver quickstart.md):
###   FR-004 a FR-009 (manifiestos Kustomize y despliegue en kind), FR-010 a FR-015 (CI y protección de main en infra),
###   FR-016 a FR-017 (release-please en infra), FR-018 a FR-023 (Argo CD y PR automático de tag), FR-024 a FR-027 (documentación, secretos y regresiones).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@webUrl = http://localhost:4200

### FR-001 / US1-3 "liveness accesible sin token ni detalles internos" — expects 200 {"status":"UP"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness

> {%
client.test("liveness returns 200 UP without details", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200, got " + response.status);
    client.assert(response.body.status === "UP", "Expected status UP");
    client.assert(response.body.components === undefined, "Expected no internal components");
});
%}

### FR-001 / US1-3 "readiness accesible sin token ni detalles internos" — expects 200 {"status":"UP"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

> {%
client.test("readiness returns 200 UP without details", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200, got " + response.status);
